# All 64 squares, generated once. Dark squares are the playable ones; the
# derivation rules rely on every square existing so empty destinations bind.

@prefix ck: <http://wazoo.dev/ontology/checkers#> .
@prefix b: <http://wazoo.dev/board/> .

